What:		/sys/bus/iio/devices/iio:deviceX/out_currentY_en
KernelVersion:	6.13
Contact:	linux-iio@vger.kernel.org
Description:
		Enable or disable the output of channel Y. Writing 1 enables
		the channel output; writing 0 puts it in high-Z. Requires
		enable-gpios in the device tree to have effect.

What:		/sys/bus/iio/devices/iio:deviceX/out_current100_raw
What:		/sys/bus/iio/devices/iio:deviceX/out_current101_raw
What:		/sys/bus/iio/devices/iio:deviceX/out_current102_raw
What:		/sys/bus/iio/devices/iio:deviceX/out_current103_raw
KernelVersion:	6.13
Contact:	linux-iio@vger.kernel.org
Description:
		DAC INPUT B code for toggle channel Y (index 100-103 corresponding
		to physical channels 0-3). Used as the second output level in
		toggle mode. The index offset of 100 distinguishes toggle channels
		from physical channels (0-3). Valid range is 0 to 65535.
